# Citing the Heliosonic Sonifier

### BibTeX
```bibtex
@software{Paquete2026Heliosonic,
  author  = {Hugo Paquete and DeepSeek AI},
  title   = {Heliosonic Sonifier: NOAA Solar Wind Sonification},
  year    = {2026},
  version = {18.5},
  url     = {https://github.com/hugopaquete/heliosonic},
  note    = {Funded by FCT (2024.09158.CEECIND) - AI as Catalyst}
}
```

### APA (7th ed.)
> Paquete, H. (2026). *Heliosonic Sonifier: NOAA solar wind sonification*
> (Version 18.5) [Computer software]. GitHub. https://github.com/hugopaquete/heliosonic

### Chicago (17th ed.)
> Paquete, Hugo. *Heliosonic Sonifier: NOAA Solar Wind Sonification*.
> Version 18.5. 2026. https://github.com/hugopaquete/heliosonic.
